OL,3,GNEWSAStudent flats proposed above
OL,4,Aformer tattoo studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudent flats could be created above a
OL,7,Fformer tattoo studio in a city centre.
OL,9,FAn application to Sunderland City
OL,10,FCouncil's planning department is
OL,11,Fseeking permission to change the use of
OL,12,Fpart of 24 Fawcett Street.
OL,14,FThe plans, from applicant Gills Fryfry
OL,15,FLtd, propose converting the building's
OL,16,Fupper floors to six "student studios"
OL,17,Falong with alterations to the shopfront
OL,18,Fto insert a doorway access to them.
OL,20,FA decision on the plan is expected
OL,21,Ffollowing a consultation.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
